Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=0}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.07,0:00:14.01,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NTwo years have passed since the war\Nbetween the Navy, the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:14.01,0:00:15.91,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Whitebeard Alliance,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.91,0:00:20.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,but its repercussions are still\Nfelt throughout the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:20.05,0:00:24.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the deserted island of Luscaina,\Nnorthwest of Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.99,0:00:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARGARET]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.89,0:00:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.14,0:00:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NTime really sneaks up on you, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.24,0:00:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two years already.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.68,0:01:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.99,0:01:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.69,0:01:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.89,0:01:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFind someone else\Nto eat. She's my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:30.83,0:01:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.80,0:01:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, the ship is all ready to sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.37,0:01:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give the word, and we'll be off.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NGot it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.77,0:01:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.78,0:01:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've known.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.98,0:01:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the boss of the whole island now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.94,0:01:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, it's kind of a shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was planning on eating these guys,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.27,0:01:54.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but since we're friends now,\Nthat would be weird, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.71,0:01:56.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They still look pretty yummy, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about food.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.93,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have all of your favorites\Nready and waiting on the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.19,0:02:05.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I'm so thoughtful,\NI wouldn't blame you
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.32,0:02:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you wanted to get\Nmarried right away.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.02,0:02:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI'll pass on the marriage,\Nbut thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.06,0:02:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Cold as ever, and yet\Nmy heart is on fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.66,0:02:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANDERSONIA]\NI heard that Rayleigh left\Na whole six months ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.10,0:02:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I assume he's waiting for\Nyou back on Sabaody now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.37,0:02:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah, I learned the basics\Na little ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.51,0:02:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to say bye\Nto my friends here, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.95,0:02:33.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo long, you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.95,0:02:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.68,0:04:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BARTENDER A]\NDid you hear? They relocated Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOh? Did they now?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.38,0:04:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They traded locations\Nwith a branch called G1.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.29,0:04:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That moved them to the\Nother side of the Red Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.05,0:04:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their new fleet admiral's a lot\Nmore cocky than Sengoku was.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moved right into the Four\NEmperor's territory.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.81,0:05:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not afraid to stare\Ndown the toughest pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.52,0:05:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the upside, that keeps them out\Nof our business, but on the downside,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've got a lot more\Ncriminals running around
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.80,0:05:12.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and nobody to stop them\Nif things get ugly.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.15,0:05:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.32,0:05:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It did seem like there were an awful\Nlot of thugs compared to two years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN A]\NHey, did you catch this?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.66,0:05:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN B]\NYeah, it's a shocker, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.23,0:05:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had to do a double take,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it looks like the Straw\NHats are back after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never heard word of them\Ndying or anything,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.54,0:05:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but two years is a long time for\Nanyone to just disappear like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.21,0:05:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN A]\NEither way, looks like they're\Nrecruiting some new members.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN C]\NThis is a good place for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.86,0:05:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you made it here, that means you\Nsurvived the first half of the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.43,0:05:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and those guys keep pouring in.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN B]\NHis crew's pretty small.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.82,0:05:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Makes sense that he'd wanna pick up some\Nmore before heading to the New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.06,0:05:49.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd make a great Straw Hat, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN B]\NFat chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.76,0:05:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's guys with 100 million berry\Nbounties all over the place here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN C]\NHa. What would\Nthey want with a chump like you?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.80,0:05:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN B laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN A]\NThat's cruel, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.47,0:06:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GOSSIPING MAN A gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.44,0:06:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something you can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.25,0:06:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like what? We're sold out!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Soul King World Tour!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.45,0:06:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't waltz up and buy tickets\Nwhen the show is about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the final concert\Nof the tour, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear 'em?\NThe crowd is ready to rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.61,0:06:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FANS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.25,0:06:30.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, manager!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.93,0:06:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make this the greatest\Nshow of my afterlife!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.02,0:06:37.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LONGARM BOSS]\NWell, of course! Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.22,0:06:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now would be the time!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.32,0:06:40.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your TDs are at the\Nheight of their sales.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, we just broke a million!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.16,0:06:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You certainly earned your\Ntitle as the King of Soul.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just listen to those fans\Nchanting your name!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.47,0:06:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BROOK]\NI can dig it, boss man.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.60,0:06:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}But one thing before the concert.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got somethin' heavy to lay on ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm all ears, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:10.09,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SOUL KING FANS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.92,0:07:41.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LONGARM BOSS]\NI'm gonna wring his sorry neck bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How selfish can he be?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Grab me a transponder snail!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.96,0:07:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you\Nwalk all over me, Brook!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.81,0:08:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Women! Real women!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.85,0:08:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No stubble! No hairy\Nlegs! No giant chins!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.02,0:08:21.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just honest to goodness\Nbeautiful girls!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.09,0:08:23.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How I've longed for your\Ndelicate features.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.29,0:08:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your soft skin.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.83,0:08:27.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hear the intoxicating words\Nresting on your sweet lips!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Viva Sabaody!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.59,0:08:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.89,0:08:34.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PINK-STRIPED QUEEN]\NSanji, dear!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like this is farewell.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.97,0:08:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate to part, but we'll\Nmeet again someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.53,0:08:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope not!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.61,0:08:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SANJI]\NUh!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.98,0:08:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride and say\Nhi to Iva, but go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.89,0:08:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up, ladies?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.05,0:08:51.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fresh outta hell and\Nlookin' for a good time!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.53,0:08:56.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like they say, if a boy picks on a girl,\Nthat means he has a crush on her.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.26,0:08:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. Happens to me all the time.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Love is patient, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll wait! We know you'll come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.96,0:09:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way, Nami-swan!\NRobin, my love!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.47,0:09:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.71,0:09:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN]\NWhat's the matter, can't read?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.54,0:09:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or are you just stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.25,0:09:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know preschoolers with\Nhigher bounties than that.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.65,0:09:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you check that poster again.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.86,0:09:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If your bounty is under 70\Nmillion, then we don't want you.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.53,0:09:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why don't you take your weak\Nass back to pirate daycare?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.73,0:09:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's all you're worth, it's\Na wonder you made it this far.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NNow scram.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.88,0:09:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the son of Dragon\Nthe Revolutionary!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.01,0:09:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I ain't got time for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.83,0:09:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.06,0:09:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're the chosen ones, boyo.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.46,0:09:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No chumps are gonna run with this crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.83,0:09:52.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're in a league of our own!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.97,0:09:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you can't get with us,\Nyou better get the hell out of our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.23,0:10:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.84,0:10:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.48,0:10:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's rough. Straw Hat is fierce.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Course he is. He's a legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.51,0:10:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the count, Franky?\NHow many recruits we got?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE FRANKY]\N'Bout a hundred last time I checked.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.79,0:10:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three whole crews joined up\Nalong with ten guys running solo.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.89,0:10:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've got some nice bounties, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.71,0:10:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know two of 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.44,0:10:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pair of high-profile rookies\Njoined at the same time.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.94,0:10:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Wet-Haired" Caribou\Nand "Blood Splatter" Coribou.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They love killin' Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.51,0:10:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brothers and captains worth\N210 million and 190 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.78,0:10:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Now, they answer to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's more where they came from!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bring another round!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.76,0:10:49.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.63,0:10:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better make it quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.36,0:10:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah. I see you sittin'\Nalone over there, missy.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.07,0:11:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna have a good time,\Nwhy don't you party with us?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.48,0:11:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a real looker, ain't she?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.93,0:11:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll pass. I'm here\Nwaiting for a friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is about to get ugly.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.74,0:11:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, I would not turn that man down.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.41,0:11:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You realize that's Straw\NHat Luffy, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.78,0:11:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the same Straw Hat\Nthat burst into Marineford
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.51,0:11:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and went head to head\Nwith the Navy Admirals.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.06,0:11:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's nuts.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.03,0:11:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.78,0:11:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waitin' for a friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.01,0:11:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy is a star, baby.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your "friend" would probably\Npiss his pants if he saw him.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.56,0:11:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come drink with some real men.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.56,0:11:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm only going to say this once.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.00,0:11:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can take your offer and shove it,\N'cause I'm way out of your league.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.04,0:11:52.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.31,0:11:53.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.91,0:11:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mister... whoever you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't know me?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.57,0:12:03.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BARTENDER A gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Straw Hat Luffy, you wench!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.05,0:12:10.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! Say you're sorry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.09,0:12:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.36,0:12:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody disrespects me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.89,0:12:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Har-har. You think you're\Nreal cute, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make this super simple, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.34,0:12:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either you come drink with\NCaptain Luffy, or you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.33,0:12:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE NAMI giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.33,0:12:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For your info, I have a bounty, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.80,0:12:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the Straw Hat's navigator, Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.66,0:12:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You scared yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.53,0:12:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack... Green Star...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}"Devil"!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE NAMI screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.52,0:13:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa. What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE NAMI]\NCaptain! Save me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.69,0:13:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NSave yourself! Get away from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.47,0:13:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A giant plant? Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.65,0:13:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there, beautiful.\NCan I buy ya a drink?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.99,0:13:18.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.75,0:13:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.85,0:13:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at you! Those\Nmuscles! And that hair!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.76,0:13:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You tough guy! You\Nlook great! I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NUh, thanks. Uh, your,\Nuh, hair looks nice, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.90,0:13:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hot girl was waiting\Nfor that pencil-nosed geek?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What does he have that we don't?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.38,0:13:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New special move, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.74,0:13:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.21,0:13:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYeah, they come from\Nseeds called "pop greens."
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.55,0:13:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, I wasn't just sitting\Naround on my tail these past two years.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.94,0:13:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a new me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of the "weakling trio"
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.51,0:13:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with you and Chopper anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.55,0:13:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means no more running and hiding.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a real warrior now!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.58,0:14:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Hey, dude? If you did\Nthis, could you undo it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.42,0:14:04.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?! Sniper King?! But how?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.49,0:14:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, forget about them!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.79,0:14:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get outta here. There's\Nsomething we need to talk about.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stop right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.86,0:14:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(632,1053)}– Luffy?\N[NAMI]\N– Ignore him!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.57,0:14:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, you haven't paid your tab yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.57,0:14:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NKeep the change!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap! They're makin' fools of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.46,0:14:21.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gun 'em down now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.20,0:14:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.04,0:14:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, guys? What are those\Nweird bubble things?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.21,0:14:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[popping]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.60,0:14:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NI have a feelin'\Nthis ain't gonna be pretty.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.28,0:14:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[thunder rumbles]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN A screaming]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.60,0:14:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so I picked up some\Nnew special moves myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.60,0:15:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You show off! Can't you\Nlet me be cool for once?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.42,0:15:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN C gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.66,0:15:21.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE FRANKY coughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.87,0:15:27.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do they think they are?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.83,0:15:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hunt those bastards down\Nand murder 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.44,0:15:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE A]\NI have a report, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.81,0:15:38.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From Sabaody Archipelago!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.04,0:15:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? You say the Straw Hats are back?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.71,0:15:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.41,0:15:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Word is that they're recruiting new crew\Nmembers before they head to the New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.38,0:15:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Had a feeling Straw\NHat was still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.54,0:15:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inform Headquarters\Nof this immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.94,0:15:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send in as many backup\Nunits as we can spare
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.55,0:15:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and begin a search of\Nthe entire archipelago.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.21,0:15:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Sir!\N– Sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.37,0:16:19.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I shook them off.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.77,0:16:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NBrook is holding a concert and the Straw\NHats are looking for new recruits?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.95,0:16:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodness, I've been gone for too long.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.42,0:16:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\N"Soul King" does have\Na nice ring to it, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.51,0:16:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYou're kidding me.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.65,0:16:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're saying the swordsman who barely\Nknows left from right got here first?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, whaddaya know?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he learned how to read\Na map while he was training.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.16,0:16:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After him came Franky, about ten days\Nago now, but he headed back out to go see
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.17,0:16:51.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if your ship was doing all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope that means the\NSunny is in good shape.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NOf course. There\Nisn't a single scratch on it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.71,0:16:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We finished the coating, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThat's good to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you give\Ncredit where credit's due.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.25,0:17:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if he don't, there's no\Nshame in a wound of honor.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.19,0:17:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FISH RIDERS]\N– It's time for some R'n'R!\N– It's time for some R'n'R!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knew you'd be so\Ndedicated to the cause?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your stubbornness came in handy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'mean my looks?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[DUVAL laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.94,0:17:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.\NI owed you one anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come rain or shine, it changed nothin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.29,0:17:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dangerous pirates from all\Nover came to take that ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.49,0:17:26.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't matter how bad I was hurt,\NI defended it day after day.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I knew all these\Nbruises would be worth it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.45,0:17:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– You're so amazing, sir!\N– You're so amazing, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates messed you up? Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the real story here, Duval?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.99,0:17:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm tryin' to build up the\Nsuspense here, y'know?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.49,0:17:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.89,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKKY]\NThe third member of\Nyour crew to arrive was Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.89,0:17:44.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.36,0:17:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's great! Is she still here?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.86,0:17:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She decided to kill time by\Ngetting some shopping done.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.43,0:17:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, don'tcha wanna hear\Nthe rest of I story?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.64,0:17:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami's shopping. Nami's\Nshopping. Nami's shopping...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.21,0:17:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fourth one to arrive was Usopp\Nthree days ago, who also went into town
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.22,0:18:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Followed by Chopper,\Nwho showed up yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.92,0:18:03.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook's made it, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.02,0:18:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's putting on a concert\Nfor the islanders today.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.56,0:18:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNo way.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.54,0:18:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the last to stop by,\Nwhich makes seven in total.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that I expected any less,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.88,0:18:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but almost the entire crew has\Nmade it back in good time.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.45,0:18:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NThat's right. Only\NNico Robin and Luffy remain.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.79,0:18:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Getting to this island in the\Nfirst place is a difficult task
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for any crew to accomplish.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.23,0:18:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, you've made\Nit twice. What can I say?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be eager to\Nsee each other again.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.46,0:18:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.69,0:18:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And by the way, I still can't believe\Nyou trained Luffy while we were gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.28,0:18:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must be crazy strong now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.09,0:18:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's been on his own\Nthese last six months.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.23,0:18:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how his\Nskills have developed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.83,0:18:43.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNow that you... mention it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how Nami's developed,\Nif you know what I'm sayin'!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NI should've expected that.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.05,0:18:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHey, guys! What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.45,0:18:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, talk to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.92,0:19:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be more excited\Nto see me, but you're acting weird!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.82,0:19:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, you've all\Nchanged a lot over these last two years.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.59,0:19:09.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, I mean, we're still friends,\Nso why are you ignoring me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.06,0:19:11.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, man. It's not leaving.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.22,0:19:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be shy 'cause of\Nhow much I've changed, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.29,0:19:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, that furball knows\Na little bit too much about us "Straw Hats,"
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.59,0:19:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do, and ya gotta\Nwonder why that is.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.17,0:19:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can find the answer here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NUh! No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.16,0:19:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the real deal\Ncotton-candy-lovin'
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tony Tony Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.60,0:19:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pet's comin' home!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.77,0:19:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we all look a little different\Nthan we used to, who cares?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He must've been abandoned\Non this island when they died
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and has been living\Nin the wild ever since.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now he's following us around
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.33,0:19:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because he thinks his masters\Nhave finally come back for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should ditch the mutt\Nand take him instead.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.19,0:19:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If we have their real pet, no one will\Never doubt that we're the Straw Hats again!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. What's he eat?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NProbably cotton candy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We ain't got none o' that!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.54,0:20:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE CHOPPER grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.81,0:20:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ROBIN]\NGet! We don't need you no more!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.11,0:20:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ROBIN]\NC'mere, boy, ya hungry?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.88,0:20:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.54,0:20:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yum. Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.35,0:20:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou're kinda freaking me out!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.05,0:20:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BLACK SUIT MAN A]\NNow!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.72,0:20:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ROBIN]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop! Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.79,0:20:25.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who were those creeps?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.96,0:20:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! This is a real emergency!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.49,0:20:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.31,0:20:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess we should tell\NCaptain Luffy, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe he knows how to handle this mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.87,0:20:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! I didn't know Luffy was\Nback on the island already!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.83,0:20:40.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right. And he'll\Nhave new recruits by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.57,0:20:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With the extra might,\Nwe'll save Robin for sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go get our friend back!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.48,0:20:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[BLACK SUIT MAN A]\NCalling from Sabaody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've secured Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've also caught some fox thing\Nthat won't stop biting her head.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.37,0:20:59.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely the others have\Nmade it back by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.15,0:21:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey! Are you all right? Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.52,0:21:10.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did he do that? He just\Nshot her out of the blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN B]\NThat's awful!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.39,0:21:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, we'll get a doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.53,0:21:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You! What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.57,0:21:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She didn't do a damn\Nthing to deserve that!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NUgh. I thought you were someone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.34,0:21:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said sorry. So, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.40,0:21:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm lookin' for some punks who\Ncrossed me and made a run for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.27,0:21:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A red-haired woman and\Na guy with a long nose.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.44,0:21:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you just shot her?\NThat's normal for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.60,0:21:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This won't end well.\NStraw Hat's a monster.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.69,0:21:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh? You wanna fight about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.02,0:21:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I got plenty more bullets.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.43,0:21:46.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your choice, pal.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.53,0:21:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN I screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.73,0:21:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me. Blame your nose!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.33,0:21:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey. We'll get some help! Stay with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.40,0:22:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find those punks now,\Nor I'll shoot you, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.34,0:22:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got a reputation to uphold here!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.92,0:22:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta show this place who's boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.63,0:22:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.33,0:22:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.36,0:22:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.27,0:22:28.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops. Didn't see ya there.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.34,0:22:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that. See ya.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.21,0:22:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's guy's insane!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.84,0:22:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either that, or he doesn't\Nknow who Straw Hat is.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.38,0:22:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a dead man either way!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NThere in the distance\Nis Sabaody Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Luffy, but we will\Nhave to say our goodbyes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We cannot let anyone discover\Nthe nature of our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NUh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NI've prepared...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a disguise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:17.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHa-ha. Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.85,0:23:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't pull that look off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps. But I would still feel\Nmore at ease if you took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NYou must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.63,0:23:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your face hidden at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world may believe you've\Nbeen dead these last two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that won't stop anyone from recognizing\Nyou the first time you get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.58,0:23:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if you ever want to set sail again,\Nyou'll take my advice to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThanks. I'll try.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.29,0:23:44.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, for supplies,\NI've loaded your backpack
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.99,0:23:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with 50 changes of clothes, 1,000\Nlunches, handkerchiefs, and tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:54.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll also find three years' worth\Nof water, snacks, and bug bite ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's also five years' worth\Nof towels, toothbrushes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,plenty of soaps, hand creams,\Nand lots of silverware.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is entirely too much!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you can\Nfind all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThanks again for getting\Nme here and all the other stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.06,0:24:09.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MARGARET chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were more than happy to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your most difficult trials\Nmay still be ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hear that Sabaody has\Nbecome a den of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NYON]\NMh-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And because of that, the Navy\Nhas been keeping a tight watch
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over the goings-on there\Nas of late, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So be sure to take extra care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.94,0:24:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NIf you ever need assistance, the full\Nforce of the Kuja Pirates will come rushing
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.95,0:24:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to your aide at a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.08,0:24:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, don't hesitate to call on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.12,0:24:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, would you be willing\Nto do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.99,0:24:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe. Long as\Nit's not getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.43,0:24:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I ask is that, when you leave,\Nyou do so without saying "farewell."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:49.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That all?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never said that to\Nanyone before, so sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.50,0:24:53.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wanna see you again!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.43,0:24:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK squeals]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.57,0:24:58.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:25:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right! I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.07,0:25:02.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[AMAZONS bidding adieu]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.62,0:25:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.69,0:25:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HANCOCK]\NOh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He wants to see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's practically a... a proposal!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.90,0:25:13.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's not!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.33,0:25:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hancock told me I gotta stay\Noutta trouble and lay low.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.60,0:25:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna fight this guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.31,0:25:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, dummy. Did you\Nrun into me on purpose?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.48,0:25:28.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN AA]\NOh, no. He's gonna kill that poor guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.19,0:26:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hi, Sunny.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.00,0:26:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NSorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.77,0:26:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you weren't lonely.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.37,0:26:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're as lovely as ever.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.21,0:26:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.54,0:26:28.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.71,0:26:29.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.78,0:26:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NNow who is that gorgeous lady?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.32,0:26:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Robin, of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.52,0:26:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our super archaeologist!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.33,0:26:44.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, did I miss you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.88,0:27:06.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NYou haven't\Nchanged a bit, Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.35,0:27:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NIs that a joke,\Nsister? I'm a brand new man!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.19,0:27:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm more than a man!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.72,0:27:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the stuff dreams are made of!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.43,0:27:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gaze upon this fantastic\Ntransformation,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.37,0:27:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the likes of which this\Nworld has never seen!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.18,0:27:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, baby! I'm beyond\Nhuman comprehension!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.68,0:27:25.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.88,0:27:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I might argue that you've been\Nthat way for quite some time now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.85,0:27:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHuh? So, I'm not just\Na freak, I'm a super freak?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.50,0:27:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! You're gonna make me blush!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.13,0:27:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the coating, I take it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.40,0:27:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hah. It's like jelly.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.64,0:27:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.54,0:27:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Took a little longer than we expected,\Nbut Rayleigh did his part!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.14,0:27:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bottom of the sea, here we come!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.14,0:27:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After everyone gets back, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.12,0:27:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,\NI saw Rayleigh at the bar.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOh, yeah? What number were you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.19,0:28:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who're we missin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.66,0:28:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was number eight.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.43,0:28:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, the only one left is him.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.76,0:28:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.87,0:28:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure our captain'll\Nshow up soon enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.67,0:28:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship's ready whenever he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.61,0:28:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,New weapon's ready, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.61,0:28:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.75,0:28:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds just splendid.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.52,0:28:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, where is\Neveryone else? Busy?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.20,0:28:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp and Sanji stopped\Nby here earlier.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.82,0:28:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp's pickin' up some\Nfuel for the trip.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.23,0:28:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji's getting groceries, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.61,0:28:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. I ran into something\Ninteresting on the way over.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you seen these?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.72,0:28:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.42,0:28:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's for a concert today.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.75,0:28:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's calling himself "Soul King."
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.86,0:28:46.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's a story behind that.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.26,0:28:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's big news now.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.53,0:28:51.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're sellin' his TDs\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.58,0:28:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's left the darkness far behind.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.60,0:28:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.70,0:28:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.66,0:29:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHe rose up from those foggy seas\Nand now he's a shining star.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.33,0:29:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His fans raise his name to the heavens,\Nif you'll pardon my poetry.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.89,0:29:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NHe didn't say\Nanything about this to me,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.01,0:29:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he's makin' a lot of\Npeople happy with his music.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.35,0:29:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He might not wanna be a pirate anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.62,0:29:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[SOUL KING FANS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.23,0:30:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So whaddaya gotta say for yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.67,0:30:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya can't tell me you didn't know\Nwho I was when ya crashed in ta me.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.00,0:30:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do it?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.44,0:30:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were you just tryin' to\Nmake a fool outta me?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.91,0:30:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause if so, I don't like\Nbein' shown up in public.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.08,0:30:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, I have a reputation and\Na 400 million berry bounty to uphold.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.38,0:30:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you can make it up\Nto me... by kneeling.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.62,0:30:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beg for your life and\NI might feel generous.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.08,0:30:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo! Fisherman, you in?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.45,0:30:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lookin' for some good\Nstock at a low price.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.02,0:30:37.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? This the place?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.62,0:30:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OLD FISHERMAN A whimpering]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.49,0:30:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:40.43,0:30:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you run this shack?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.00,0:30:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.03,0:30:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's something awful!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.30,0:30:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That green-haired man's gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.44,0:30:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap. All right, old man, spill it.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.17,0:30:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this\Nhas happened to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.67,0:30:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, y'see, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.78,0:31:00.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHey, gramps. I was\Nlookin' to do some fishing.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.35,0:31:00.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.85,0:31:01.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No offense, young man,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.66,0:31:06.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't exactly peg\Nyou as the fishing type.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.21,0:31:07.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NNormally you'd be right.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.80,0:31:10.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be meeting\Nsome friends on this island,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.14,0:31:13.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,but they haven't made it yet,\Nso I'm bored outta my skull.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.62,0:31:17.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So I need something to keep\Nme entertained while I wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you can help me out, or not?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.25,0:31:21.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll finish getting\Neverything we need ready,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.84,0:31:24.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,and then meet you on my\Nboat right over there.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.54,0:31:27.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's all I said to him.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.83,0:31:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be clear, did this guy have\Nthree swords and a belly warmer?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.50,0:31:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, he did! And he had a\Ndeep scar on his eye, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.69,0:31:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd ya know?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.99,0:31:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Scar's new.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.36,0:31:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this him?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:39.66,0:31:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.76,0:31:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he'd been waiting\Non some friends to show.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.49,0:31:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be you.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.66,0:31:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWell, I wouldn't go that far.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.13,0:31:48.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'see, I told him to\Nwait on my fishing boat
Dialogue: 50,0:31:48.63,0:31:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while I was getting ready, and\NI pointed right at the thing,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:51.30,0:31:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but when I came outside,\Nhe'd made a huge mistake!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.37,0:31:57.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Young man!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.03,0:32:00.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!\NYou're on a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.36,0:32:04.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, men, it's time we set sail for\Nthe New World we've been dreaming of!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.11,0:32:05.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The wait is over!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.28,0:32:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATES]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.12,0:32:08.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, please! You have to wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.35,0:32:10.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You got on the wrong ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.49,0:32:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OLD FISHERMAN A]\NSince they went underwater, I'd guess\Nthere were headed to Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:21.51,0:32:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:28.57,0:32:32.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NShould've known him showing up\Nhere first was too good to be true.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.14,0:32:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be Zoro if he didn't\Nget lost somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.98,0:32:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried at all?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:36.41,0:32:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They might kill him on that ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.91,0:32:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine, don't get worked up.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.85,0:32:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is pretty standard fare, actually.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.52,0:32:45.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better than usual, even, since we\Nknow where he's going for once.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.65,0:32:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, would you mind selling\Nme some fish already?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:47.82,0:32:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think you understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.29,0:32:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MEN chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.92,0:32:51.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[MAN N]\NWhoa! See that?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.49,0:32:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN II]\NLook at the waves!\NSomethin's coming up!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.06,0:32:55.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:57.77,0:32:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN JJ]\NBut what?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.10,0:33:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN KK]\NIt must be huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:03.94,0:33:05.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MEN gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.14,0:33:11.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[MEN]\N– Whoa!\N– Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:12.71,0:33:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN LL]\NThat's a galleon ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.65,0:33:17.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN O]\NIt must've had poor coating and was\Ncrushed under the water pressure!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it has to be the work of Sea Kings!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:19.69,0:33:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN MM]\NBut it looks like\Nit's been cut in half.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:21.43,0:33:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like someone attacked it!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:23.33,0:33:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! Just think for a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.69,0:33:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who in the world could do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:26.83,0:33:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Tell me why!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:28.60,0:33:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you just ruin our dreams\Nof reaching the New World like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:34.17,0:33:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NCall it a twist of fate.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:35.78,0:33:38.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what brought this\Nplague upon your ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.28,0:33:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And there's no one for you\Nto blame but yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.38,0:33:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:43.55,0:33:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN P]\NLook!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.42,0:33:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:45.72,0:33:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. Back already...\Nand he's still a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.56,0:34:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That... wasn't my ride.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.03,0:07:11.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.75,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love you down to my...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.05,0:07:18.42,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Bone!\N– Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.42,0:07:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.39,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Bone!\N– Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.39,0:07:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Bone!\N– Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.53,0:07:22.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.92,0:07:23.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Bone!\N– Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.53,0:07:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.89,0:07:24.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}– Bone!\N– Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.43,0:07:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! {\alpha&HFF&}Bone! Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.83,0:07:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! Bone!{\alpha&HFF&} Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.31,0:07:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone! Bone! Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.71,0:07:40.01,Rock Concert Secondary,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.28,0:29:25.58,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}{\fs52}[BROOK]\N{\fs82}♪ It's no mystery.\N{\fad(150,150)}♪ Just rock with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.35,0:29:29.18,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}♪ And you'll see why I'm the king! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.42,0:29:39.39,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}♪ Thin is in when you're a skeleton ♪\N{\fad(150,150)}♪ 'cause calcium is all that you need! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.76,0:29:39.39,Rock Concert Secondary,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}{\fs52}[BACKING VOCALS]\N– {\fs82}♪ Calcium is all that you need! ♪\N– {\fs82}♪ Calcium is all that you need! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.39,0:29:43.80,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}{\fs52}[BROOK]\N{\fs82}♪ So, ditch that fat and protein ♪\N{\fad(150,150)}♪ make your body mean and lean. ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.80,0:29:46.37,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}♪ Got milk! Got milk!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.37,0:29:54.34,Rock Concert Main,,0,0,0,,{\an2\q2\fsp1.2}{\fad(150,150)}♪ My bones are rockin' rollin', ♪\N{\fad(150,150)}♪ soul is flowin' out of my head! ♪
